# per-slot planted/null detail is part of the answer key (DECISIONS D6): never commit
**/episodes_private.jsonl
*.log

# D6: harness gate run dirs for the CURRENT agent pool (tasks/featurematch/instances/) hold per-slot truth
# (grade.json details.slots) and the reference solver's submissions (effectively the answer key), and summary.*
# list per-instance passes. Keep them local until the smoke episodes on that pool are finished; commit only the
# aggregate gates_public.json (written by tasks/featurematch/gate_report.py) and config.json.
# After the smoke run: delete these lines and commit the full run dirs.
*_gate_*/episodes/
*_gate_*/summary.json
*_gate_*/summary.md
*_gate_*/gate_private.json
*_gate_*/.config.lock

# Orchestrator LLM-probe dirs (API / OpenAI agents) on a pool: their grade.json holds per-slot planted/null flags
# (audit MINOR 8). Keep the episode dirs local; a careless `git add runs/` must not commit part of an answer key.
*_apiprobe_*/episodes/
*_openai_probe_*/episodes/
*_probe_*/episodes/
